WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.194 --> 00:00:05.194
As we mentioned last week, we are speaking about prayer and fasting these two weeks.

2
00:00:05.194 --> 00:00:12.194
In the coming week, from Friday to Sunday, last week, we will be fasting for 10 days.

3
00:00:12.194 --> 00:00:14.194
And we want to invite you to join in.

4
00:00:14.194 --> 00:00:18.194
Last week we talked about why you would fast.

5
00:00:18.194 --> 00:00:24.194
And this week we are talking about what you can fast from and how we will fast and what we will pray for.

6
00:00:24.194 --> 00:00:26.194
This is the Big Week Update.

7
00:00:30.194 --> 00:00:37.194
This week we talked about why you would fast.

8
00:00:37.194 --> 00:00:42.194
I want to start with a principle from the Bible.

9
00:00:42.194 --> 00:00:47.194
We have said that we want to invite all of you back into this.

10
00:00:47.194 --> 00:00:55.194
So we have said that we want to go into the class, but that we invite you by teaching and explaining it.

11
00:00:56.194 --> 00:01:02.194
One of the principles that I find very important, when we do a corporate class,

12
00:01:02.194 --> 00:01:05.194
is understanding that two are better than one.

13
00:01:05.194 --> 00:01:12.194
That there is a call and even a calling when we do it together.

14
00:01:14.194 --> 00:01:20.194
The Bible speaks about how when we do it together, we have much more ground.

15
00:01:20.194 --> 00:01:25.194
But there is also this natural aspect, when you and I do it together in our household,

16
00:01:25.194 --> 00:01:28.194
then it is somehow easier.

17
00:01:28.194 --> 00:01:30.194
It increases the calling.

18
00:01:30.194 --> 00:01:34.194
So if you are joining us for the ten days starting Friday,

19
00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:41.194
then you just need to be in contact with people who are also participating, in some way.

20
00:01:41.194 --> 00:01:43.194
I would also just like to hear from you.

21
00:01:43.194 --> 00:01:49.194
Suppose you say, this is an invitation and we do it together.

22
00:01:49.194 --> 00:01:53.194
And the togetherness and doing it together, God has also created that in us,

23
00:01:53.194 --> 00:01:56.194
that we truly have desires to be together.

24
00:01:56.194 --> 00:02:04.194
And when you fast together and pray together, then you have a common goal in sight.

25
00:02:04.194 --> 00:02:10.194
And reaching a goal together gives strength, it gives unity, and it gives certainty.

26
00:02:10.194 --> 00:02:15.194
So if you decide to participate and you become enthusiastic about it,

27
00:02:15.194 --> 00:02:19.194
and you wouldn't say it, then it still has power and authority, of course.

28
00:02:19.194 --> 00:02:26.194
But it is so much better if you let us know and if you let each other know that I am going to do this.

29
00:02:26.194 --> 00:02:30.194
In whatever capacity, as we said last week,

30
00:02:30.194 --> 00:02:36.194
it is an open invitation to Open Church, we are going to fast. Are you joining us?

31
00:02:36.194 --> 00:02:41.194
And if you are going to participate and maybe you have done it many times before

32
00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:47.194
and you are experienced in the concept of fasting, great, join in and let's go for it.

33
00:02:47.194 --> 00:02:53.194
Maybe you have never done it before and you are interested and you say to yourself,

34
00:02:53.194 --> 00:02:59.194
well maybe I can't participate hardcore yet, but I do want to join in some capacity.

35
00:02:59.194 --> 00:03:03.194
Be enthusiastic about that in your heart.

36
00:03:03.194 --> 00:03:12.194
Know that it is an invitation and that it is not a heaviness, because I am enthusiastic about it.

37
00:03:34.194 --> 00:03:41.194
If you and I do a certain thing, then you reap what that thing was.

38
00:03:41.194 --> 00:03:45.194
If you practice for an hour, you gain energy, you gain health.

39
00:03:45.194 --> 00:03:54.194
So there is a logical thing where God says, if you eat this way and not that way,

40
00:03:54.194 --> 00:04:02.194
for the purpose of getting closer to me, for the purpose of gaining more spiritual vitality.

41
00:04:02.194 --> 00:04:05.194
and to be more livable for the spirit and the things of God.

42
00:04:05.194 --> 00:04:08.194
There will be a call.

43
00:04:08.194 --> 00:04:10.194
And one more important thing I wanted to...

44
00:04:10.194 --> 00:04:13.194
Just one more thing, okay? Do you know what the basic Bible says?

45
00:04:13.194 --> 00:04:17.194
You discussed this last week in the midweek, but I'm going to say it to you now.

46
00:04:17.194 --> 00:04:23.194
But the basic Bible translates it for us already and says, if you do not eat to focus on God.

47
00:04:24.194 --> 00:04:28.194
Other Bible translations simply say, if you fast.

48
00:04:28.194 --> 00:04:30.194
But the basic Bible already indicates it to us.

49
00:04:30.194 --> 00:04:32.194
So that's pretty cool.

50
00:04:32.194 --> 00:04:38.194
Why fast? If you don't eat for a day or if you don't eat for a period to focus on God.

51
00:04:38.194 --> 00:04:41.194
And that's exactly what you just said, where do you invest?

52
00:04:41.194 --> 00:04:45.194
We invest by fasting to focus on God.

53
00:04:45.194 --> 00:04:47.194
And he says, we are focused on God.

54
00:04:47.194 --> 00:04:48.194
Yes.

55
00:04:58.194 --> 00:05:00.194
Yes, then it's just not about yourself for a moment.

56
00:05:00.194 --> 00:05:19.194
Yes, I once fasted for five days during a Bible college. Five days without eating anything.

57
00:05:19.194 --> 00:05:23.194
And during that time, it was really just heaven on earth for me personally.

58
00:05:23.194 --> 00:05:27.194
Truly revelation upon revelation. I couldn't even open the Bible.

59
00:05:27.194 --> 00:05:32.194
And the words jumped out. That was so powerful for me at that time, so amazing.

60
00:05:32.194 --> 00:05:34.194
And for me, it was really like, wow.

61
00:05:34.194 --> 00:05:39.194
And I have also had another period of fasting where I had to pull myself through it.

62
00:05:39.194 --> 00:05:43.194
That I thought to myself, I would rather stop than go through this.

63
00:05:43.194 --> 00:05:51.194
So for different people and also for different periods, it can evoke different reactions.

64
00:05:57.194 --> 00:06:05.194
So the expansion, or the expansion, the reward of feeling more alive for God, can come exactly after the ten days.

65
00:06:05.194 --> 00:06:09.194
It can come the next time you read your words after the fast.

66
00:06:09.194 --> 00:06:13.194
And then you think, wow, everything feels alive.

67
00:06:13.194 --> 00:06:18.194
And that is because there is a sense of purification or detoxification.

68
00:06:18.194 --> 00:06:19.194
Yes.

69
00:06:19.194 --> 00:06:23.194
It is not really a health reason that we do this, although it promotes health.

70
00:06:23.194 --> 00:06:26.194
But there is a kind of detoxification of the soul.

71
00:06:26.194 --> 00:06:28.194
There is an access to the inner man.

72
00:06:28.194 --> 00:06:31.194
Because we spend so much time on the outer man.

73
00:06:31.194 --> 00:06:36.194
We eat, we look at the shell in which we live.

74
00:06:36.194 --> 00:06:40.194
And the soul realm is within us, the heart realm.

75
00:06:40.194 --> 00:06:42.194
But the spirit man is even deeper.

76
00:06:42.194 --> 00:06:44.194
He also wants to eat.

77
00:06:44.194 --> 00:06:47.194
But his food is this.

78
00:06:47.194 --> 00:06:50.194
The spirit wants the living Word.

79
00:06:50.194 --> 00:06:55.194
And so to set ourselves up to give up physical time.

80
00:06:55.194 --> 00:06:58.194
To set our spirit man to be full.

81
00:06:58.194 --> 00:07:00.194
Man, you will see blessings.

82
00:07:00.194 --> 00:07:02.194
You will see a responsibility.

83
00:07:02.194 --> 00:07:04.194
Yes, I hope so for you.

84
00:07:04.194 --> 00:07:06.194
And I tell you this already in the name of Jesus.

85
00:07:06.194 --> 00:07:09.194
That you will indeed really experience it.

86
00:07:09.194 --> 00:07:12.194
That God also gives that reward.

87
00:07:12.194 --> 00:07:15.194
And that you believe it will come.

88
00:07:15.194 --> 00:07:18.194
So we are going to what I can fast.

89
00:07:18.194 --> 00:07:20.194
What can I fast?

90
00:07:20.194 --> 00:07:22.194
And so again biblically.

91
00:07:22.194 --> 00:07:25.194
We have talked a lot about social media fasting.

92
00:07:25.194 --> 00:07:28.194
Fasting from TV, movies, extra things.

93
00:07:28.194 --> 00:07:30.194
That take our time and focus.

94
00:07:30.194 --> 00:07:35.194
And in a time of fasting, when we fast like this.

95
00:07:35.194 --> 00:07:37.194
That is a given for us.

96
00:07:37.194 --> 00:07:40.194
We will not lose time on social media.

97
00:07:40.194 --> 00:07:42.194
That is a given.

98
00:07:42.194 --> 00:07:46.194
But true biblical fasting is the giving up of a kind of food.

99
00:07:46.194 --> 00:07:49.194
Whether it is total or partial.

100
00:07:49.194 --> 00:07:51.194
And that is what we are going to talk about.

101
00:08:17.194 --> 00:08:20.194
Fasting is fasting.

102
00:08:20.194 --> 00:08:23.194
And fasting means no eating.

103
00:08:23.194 --> 00:08:26.194
In whatever form of no eating at all.

104
00:08:26.194 --> 00:08:30.194
If you say to yourself, I have never done this before.

105
00:08:30.194 --> 00:08:34.194
And this is highly unusual for me.

106
00:08:34.194 --> 00:08:38.194
Then I say in all grace and all pleasure.

107
00:08:38.194 --> 00:08:41.194
Do something that you normally do.

108
00:08:41.194 --> 00:08:45.194
And use that to worship the Lord during that time.

109
00:08:45.194 --> 00:08:50.194
But the ultimate goal is that we eventually as a culture of Open Church.

110
00:08:50.194 --> 00:08:53.194
Ultimately, we will come into a mode.

111
00:08:53.194 --> 00:08:55.194
Where we understand each other.

112
00:08:55.194 --> 00:08:58.194
When we fast, it has to do with food.

113
00:08:58.194 --> 00:09:00.194
That is actually the goal of it.

114
00:09:00.194 --> 00:09:05.194
So you have, for example, the complete no eating fast.

115
00:09:05.194 --> 00:09:08.194
And water and maybe juices.

116
00:09:08.194 --> 00:09:11.194
Which is extreme.

117
00:09:11.194 --> 00:09:14.194
In the sense that you have never done that before.

118
00:09:14.194 --> 00:09:18.194
And we recommend that for everyone first.

119
00:09:18.194 --> 00:09:21.194
Especially if this is really new.

120
00:09:21.194 --> 00:09:24.194
And you say, I just want to jump in somewhere.

121
00:09:24.194 --> 00:09:28.194
Especially when you are physically ill.

122
00:09:28.194 --> 00:09:32.194
Or you have problems, or you have a very heavy job.

123
00:09:32.194 --> 00:09:35.194
Then that is not necessary.

124
00:09:35.194 --> 00:09:39.194
Not eating at all is really intense.

125
00:09:39.194 --> 00:09:43.194
I once went 5 days without eating, only drinking.

126
00:09:43.194 --> 00:09:44.194
That is very intense.

127
00:09:44.194 --> 00:09:47.194
And that actually involves a bit of preparation.

128
00:09:47.194 --> 00:09:51.194
Yes, then you shouldn't have eaten normally on Thursday.

129
00:09:51.194 --> 00:09:53.194
And on Friday suddenly go for 10 days.

130
00:09:53.194 --> 00:09:56.194
So the next 10 days, 10 days long without eating.

131
00:09:56.194 --> 00:09:58.194
Is something we do not recommend.

132
00:09:58.194 --> 00:10:02.194
Unless you say, I am very experienced with this and I will do it.

133
00:10:02.194 --> 00:10:07.194
Yes, and you understand how to do it with good juices and so on.

134
00:10:07.194 --> 00:10:09.194
What you just said is also very important.

135
00:10:09.194 --> 00:10:11.194
That people need to know that at home.

136
00:10:11.194 --> 00:10:15.194
If you are pregnant, if you have diabetes, for example.

137
00:10:15.194 --> 00:10:20.194
Or you have something that makes you not completely healthy.

138
00:10:20.194 --> 00:10:21.194
Then don't do that.

139
00:10:21.194 --> 00:10:24.194
Or at least contact your doctor.

140
00:10:24.194 --> 00:10:26.194
To see what I can do, what I cannot do.

141
00:10:26.194 --> 00:10:30.194
So we, by all means, understand well.

142
00:10:30.194 --> 00:10:36.194
This is not an invitation to push your body to extremism.

143
00:10:36.194 --> 00:10:38.194
That's not what this is about.

144
00:10:38.194 --> 00:10:42.194
This is about what you have explained very well, also with the Beatitudes.

145
00:10:42.194 --> 00:10:45.194
That you hunger for the things of God.

146
00:10:45.194 --> 00:10:47.194
To focus yourself on God.

147
00:11:08.194 --> 00:11:27.194
Not eating. Yes, it's just not eating.

148
00:11:27.194 --> 00:11:28.194
What can be done, by the way.

149
00:11:28.194 --> 00:11:35.194
What can be done is that you say, for those 10 days, I will not eat anything for 1 day at all.

150
00:11:35.194 --> 00:11:38.194
So the concept of not eating, zero, is possible.

151
00:11:38.194 --> 00:11:41.194
But then, for example, for an agreed time.

152
00:12:05.194 --> 00:12:34.194
I can say for myself, I will focus on only vegetables, only nuts, only fruit for the next 10 days.

153
00:12:35.194 --> 00:12:41.194
And that's it.

154
00:12:41.194 --> 00:12:42.194
And in that way, I ensure that with the vegetables, the fruit, and the nuts.

155
00:12:42.194 --> 00:12:47.194
I do have the energy to function.

156
00:12:47.194 --> 00:12:50.194
But, I can even refer to and testify from this past January.

157
00:12:50.194 --> 00:12:57.194
