And that is the time when you say, yes, but I focus on God.

159
00:13:00.194 --> 00:13:04.194
And that hunger creates a kind of clarity, a kind of clarity.

160
00:13:04.194 --> 00:13:11.194


161
00:13:11.194 --> 00:13:15.194
And that is good for feeding your spiritual body.

162
00:13:30.194 --> 00:13:40.194
Then we will come shortly to what it means to fast.

163
00:14:00.194 --> 00:14:10.194
Fasting is a combination of one or two meals a day.

164
00:14:10.194 --> 00:14:14.194
So you can't say, okay, I'm not going to fast completely.

165
00:14:14.194 --> 00:14:18.194
But I can skip my breakfast and lunch.

166
00:14:18.194 --> 00:14:20.194
Or to have more time.

167
00:14:20.194 --> 00:14:23.194
