The whole day, the whole workday, living day, I do not eat.

175
00:14:46.194 --> 00:14:48.194
But I am busy with the things of God.

176
00:14:48.194 --> 00:14:53.194
While you work, life just goes on.

177
00:14:53.194 --> 00:14:55.194
You don't take ten days off for this.

178
00:14:55.194 --> 00:14:56.194
Life just goes on.

179
00:14:56.194 --> 00:15:00.194
But then you can say from sunrise to sunset I will also fast.

180
00:15:00.194 --> 00:15:04.194
But when the sun sets, I will take one meal.

181
00:15:04.194 --> 00:15:07.194
So it is a kind of combination effect.

182
00:15:07.194 --> 00:15:10.194
You can wake up and just close the morning.

183
